        "depth": 2,
        "epoch": 1,
        "hypothesis": "The distance block remains legally SIMD-vectorizable, while top-k insertion is dependency-constrained. When the candidate list contains no NaNs, a candidate at least as far as the current kth distance cannot enter the list, so rejecting it before the serial scan should preserve strict tie ordering while reducing dependent comparisons.",
